WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.576
Investing in Venezuela? The opportunity is real.

00:00:03.586 --> 00:00:05.443
So is the risk.

00:00:06.793 --> 00:00:10.441
The U.S. State Department rates Venezuela Level 3:

00:00:10.451 --> 00:00:14.099
Reconsider Travel. So the real questions are simple.

00:00:14.109 --> 00:00:17.299
What's happening on my people's route today?

00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:20.660
And who's watching if something goes wrong?

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:25.736
That's why we built Secure Ground, by CECOM-Intel, the

00:00:25.746 --> 00:00:27.812
command center of CSSG Global.

00:00:27.822 --> 00:00:32.123
We study the ground before your people step on it.

00:00:33.473 --> 00:00:35.991
Five capabilities. One service.

00:00:37.673 --> 00:00:40.142
How we operate. Before every trip:

00:00:40.152 --> 00:00:43.447
open-source monitoring, and a route and risk briefing.

00:00:43.457 --> 00:00:47.166
During the operation: our own team on the move,

00:00:47.176 --> 00:00:50.884
the command center watching live, and our human network

00:00:50.894 --> 00:00:52.537
on the ground. After:

00:00:52.547 --> 00:00:56.255
a full report, so you know what happened, and

00:00:56.265 --> 00:00:57.655
what comes next.

00:00:59.005 --> 00:01:02.526
Open-source monitoring, with every source graded.

00:01:03.876 --> 00:01:07.994
A trusted human network that confirms what no screen can.

00:01:09.343 --> 00:01:12.107
A live map built around your operation.

00:01:12.117 --> 00:01:15.040
Your sites, your routes, your risk zones.

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:18.844
Clear reporting, bottom line first.

00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:37.871
Every vehicle is GPS-tracked, with a dashcam on board.

00:01:39.221 --> 00:01:43.524
If something goes wrong, one button sends the exact

00:01:43.534 --> 00:01:46.560
location, and a coordinated response begins.

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:50.208
No rumors. No unsupervised trips.

00:01:50.218 --> 00:01:53.138
No guessing where your people are.

00:01:54.487 --> 00:01:57.518
Seventeen years in Venezuela.

00:01:57.528 --> 00:02:03.000
ISO 9001 certified. Serving G7 diplomatic missions.

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:09.833
Request a sample briefing at cssg-global.com, and let's plan

00:02:09.843 --> 00:02:12.885
your team's next trip together.

00:02:12.895 --> 00:02:15.487
CECOM-Intel. Know, then decide.
